      {
        "sentence": 26,
        "en": "First in terms of personal space, generally speaking, in a high-context culture, because there’s greater dependency on group thinking, people lean towards heavier sensory involvement or closeness to people.",
        "at": "because there’s greater dependency",
        "zh": [
          "首先来看私人空间。一般来说，在高语境文化中，",
