              317.59
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 48,
        "en": "There’s more emphasis on individuality, so the concept of privacy is very very important, whereas before as I said, in a high-context culture they might not even be concerned with privacy or personal space.",
        "at": "whereas before as I said,",
        "zh": [
